title: Across the Rhine
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and c_french_timer <= 0 and time >= 5
on-arrival: c_french_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: international

= Across the Rhine

[? if year <= 1920 : The French socialists are torn over Versailles and over Moscow. In Hamburg, Laufenberg and Wolffheim preach a people's war against the Entente, side by side with the Red Army. ?][? if year >= 1921 and ruhr_occupied = 0 : At Tours, most of the French socialists founded a Communist Party. French troops stand on the Rhine, and Paris demands the reparations in coal and gold. ?][? if ruhr_occupied = 1 : French and Belgian troops occupy the Ruhr. The nationalists cry for resistance, and the French communists who protested are in prison. ?]

- @joint: Campaign with the French comrades against both governments.
- @national_bolsheviks: Print Laufenberg's call for a people's war.
- @nation: Speak to the ruined middle classes.
- @easy_discard

@joint
subtitle: [? if ruhr_occupied = 1 : The Ruhr miners hear French communists speak against Poincaré. ?][? if ruhr_occupied = 0 : The papers of both parties print each other's statements. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.world_revolution += 3;
if (Q.ruhr_occupied == 1) {
    RG.district('ruhr', {loyalty: 6, militancy: 3});
}
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

[? if ruhr_occupied = 1 : Delegates of the French and German parties meet in Essen and issue a common appeal against Poincaré and against Cuno. ?]

@national_bolsheviks
subtitle: Hamburg's Left Radicals cheer. Radek calls it madness, and so does everyone else.
view-if: year <= 1920 and ultraleft_gone = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction += 8;
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 6;
RG.ecci('radek', -6);
Q.lean_ultraleft += 1;
!}

@nation
subtitle: [? if lock_moscow_orders = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Moscow's new line. Some come to our meetings in nationalist uniforms.
view-if: ruhr_occupied = 1
choose-if: lock_moscow_orders < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids taking orders from Moscow.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_moscow_orders == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.spd_relation -= 5;
RG.ecci('radek', 8);
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 5;
!}

Our speakers tell the ruined shopkeepers and students that their enemy is not France but the German capitalists who sold them out.
